WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.150
Muslims believe Abraham and his son
Ishmael built the Ka'bah in Makkah.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.580
The Qur'an names 25 prophets, and Muslims
believe a messenger was sent to every

3
00:00:10.630 --> 00:00:11.590
nation.

4
00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.700
Adam, the first, and Abraham,
who turned from the idols:

5
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.080
Muslims honour every one of them.

6
00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:21.770
Yet the Qur'an calls one of
them the Seal of the Prophets.

7
00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:25.270
So why do Muslims call
Muhammad the last of them all?

8
00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.220
In this mission, you'll
follow a chain of prophets,

9
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.460
starting with Adam, the first.

10
00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:34.990
Then you'll weigh up a claim: that
Muhammad is the most important prophet for

11
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:36.050
Muslims.

12
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:40.910
Your mission: find out why Muslims
call Muhammad the last of the prophets.
